#Lua SEXPs


$Operator: force-mouse-toggle-status
$Category: Change
$Subcategory: LUA-Action
$Minimum Arguments: 1
$Return Type: Nothing
$Description: This sexp forces the mouse movement flight mode to either On or Off. Note this sexp only works in singelplayer.
$Parameter: 
	+Description: Status to set for the mouse movement mode. True is on (mouse is in manuver mode) and False is off (mouse in is aiming mode). 
	+Type: Boolean


#End